 "message": "I made a 8-frame one-shot of pale blue angel wings that unfurl from a small point, hold for a few frames, then fade while small feather flecks drift down. The wings are a flat pale blue with a slight see-through, and the feathers are small custom sprites; the last frame is empty because the effect has fully faded. Things to try: the wing \"spread\" and \"feathers\" count, but I couldn't make the wings look strongly translucent or add a dark outline, so they read more as solid pale shapes than the see-through glass you described.",
